    "created_at": "2015-10-07T20:00:51Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-10-07T20:01:00Z",
    "body": "Worst case, I guess you could immediately reject `*Notifications()` if either is not in \"stable\" state. I don't think that's great tho. As each returns a promise, there would not need to be a race so long as the internal state of start/stop is known.  \n",
